LICENSE
=======

This repository contains research code accompanying the manuscript:
"A pupillary contrast response in mice and humans - Neural mechanisms and visual functions"
by Fitzpatrick et al., 2024

LICENSE TO BE DETERMINED
------------------------

Please specify the license under which this code is released. Common options for 
research code include:

1. MIT License - Permissive, allows commercial use with attribution
2. GNU GPL v3.0 - Copyleft, requires derivative works to be open source
3. Apache 2.0 - Permissive, with patent grant
4. BSD 3-Clause - Permissive, simple and well-established
5. Creative Commons (CC BY 4.0) - Common for research data/code

For guidance on choosing a license, see: https://choosealicense.com/

